title: "AMEM-Net: Adaptive Memory Expert Network for Self-Supervised Industrial Visual Anomaly Detection"
abstract: >
  A novel self-supervised industrial visual anomaly detection architecture combining
  a frozen WideResNet50-2 feature extractor, Adaptive Memory Expert Networks (AMEM),
  and a self-supervised dynamic margin router. Achieves macro-mean AUROC 97.72% across
  8 MVTec AD categories using only normal training images — no anomaly labels required.
year: 2026
